    passage: "INTERNAL MEMORANDUM\n\nTo: Legal and Procurement Teams\nFrom: Chief Operating Officer\nSubject: Supplier Contract Renewal — Action Required\n\nAll supplier contracts expiring before December 31 must be reviewed and renewed by September 30. Please prioritize contracts above $500,000 in annual value, as these require an independent audit prior to renewal.\n\nNote that our updated Master Services Agreement (MSA v3.2) includes new data protection and confidentiality clauses that must be incorporated into all renewals. Vendors must sign the updated MSA before any renewal is finalized.\n\nProcurement will coordinate directly with suppliers. Legal should flag any contracts where the counterparty has requested non-standard terms. Please send a status update to the COO's office by September 15.",
