    passage: "FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE\n\nStellar Diagnostics Closes $180 Million PIPE Financing\n\nStellar Diagnostics Inc. (NASDAQ: STLR) today announced the closing of a $180 million private investment in public equity (PIPE) financing. The transaction was led by OrbiMed Advisors and included participation from Perceptive Advisors, Deerfield Management, and three existing institutional shareholders.\n\nStellar issued 15,000,000 shares of common stock at a price of $12.00 per share, representing a 3.2% discount to the 5-day volume-weighted average price of $12.40 as of the pricing date.\n\nNet proceeds will be used to fund the pivotal Phase 3 clinical trial for STLR-202, Stellar's lead diagnostic platform for early-stage pancreatic cancer, and to extend the company's cash runway through anticipated regulatory submissions in 2027.\n\nIn connection with the PIPE, investors received warrants to purchase an additional 7,500,000 shares of common stock at an exercise price of $15.00 per share, exercisable for five years.\n\n\"This financing provides the resources to complete our pivotal trial and reach key inflection points,\" said CEO Dr. Maria Alvarado. \"We are grateful for the strong support from our leading healthcare investors.\"",
